        "conclusion": "Impression: Acute leukemia. Advise flowcytometry for further categorisation. Comments on PBS: Total count raised with DLC - Blasts 93%, Neutrophils 3%, Lymphocytes 4% Blasts are large, 1-1.5 times size of small lymphocytes with high N/C ratio, irregular nuclear membrane, opened up chromatin and 1-2 prominent nucleoli. Platelets slightly reduced.",
